# Demo: Velkommen til Lørenskog
# Klikk "Send Request" over hvert kall, ovenfra og ned.

@baseUrl = https://func-velkommen-lorenskog-ms.azurewebsites.net/api
@secret = {{$dotenv WEBHOOK_SECRET}}

### 0. Vekk databasen (kjør 5 min før demoen). Forventet: 404. Får du 500, vent 30 sek og prøv igjen.
GET {{baseUrl}}/welcome/finnes-ikke

### 1. Helsesjekk. Forventet: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Uten hemmelighet. Forventet: 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/events/move-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event_id": "demo-uten-hemmelighet",
  "full_name": "Kari Nordmann",
  "email": "kari@example.no",
  "street": "Testgata 10",
  "postal_code": "1472",
  "has_children": true
}

### 3. Ny flyttehendelse. Forventet: 201 Created
# @name moveIn
POST {{baseUrl}}/events/move-in
Content-Type: application/json
X-Webhook-Secret: {{secret}}

{
  "event_id": "demo-{{$timestamp}}",
  "full_name": "Kari Nordmann",
  "email": "kari@example.no",
  "street": "Testgata 10",
  "postal_code": "1472",
  "has_children": true
}

### 4. Samme hendelse igjen. Forventet: 200 OK, samme id (idempotens)
POST {{baseUrl}}/events/move-in
Content-Type: application/json
X-Webhook-Secret: {{secret}}

{
  "event_id": "{{moveIn.request.body.$.event_id}}",
  "full_name": "Kari Nordmann",
  "email": "kari@example.no",
  "street": "Testgata 10",
  "postal_code": "1472",
  "has_children": true
}

### 5. Hent velkomsten. Forventet: 200 med meldingen
GET {{baseUrl}}/welcome/{{moveIn.response.body.$.id}}

### 6. Ugyldig data (mangler e-post). Forventet: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/events/move-in
Content-Type: application/json
X-Webhook-Secret: {{secret}}

{
  "event_id": "demo-ugyldig",
  "full_name": "Kari Nordmann",
  "street": "Testgata 10",
  "postal_code": "1472"
}